{"version":1,"width":1080,"height":1350,"html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"nl\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"loveke-size\" content=\"1080x1350\">\n<title>Loveke Magazine</title>\n<style>/* Loveke Instagram-huisstijl. Lettertypes lokaal (fontsource), geen netwerk nodig. */\n@font-face{font-family:'Lilita One';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/lilita-one-latin-400-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-400-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-600-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:600}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-700-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:700}\n@font-face{font-family:'Caveat';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/caveat-latin-600-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:600}\n@font-face{font-family:'Caveat';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/caveat-latin-700-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:700}\n:root{--cream:#FFF8F0;--black:#1A1A1A;--orange:#FF7033;--yellow:#FFD43D;--red:#E3404B;--pink:#FF85A1}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0}\n.wm{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#E3404B 0%,#FF7033 55%,#FFC93D 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}\n.dots{background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(26,26,26,.10) 2.5px,transparent 2.5px);background-size:22px 22px}\n/* Plek voor een Instagram-sticker (poll, link, vraag, aftelling): leeg in de export. */\n.slot{visibility:hidden}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div style=\"width: 1080px; height: 1350px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FF85A1; position: relative; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; color: #1A1A1A\">\n<div class=\"dots\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: .55\"></div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 30px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 230px; line-height: .9; color: #FFF8F0; -webkit-text-stroke: 7px #1A1A1A; text-shadow: 12px 12px 0 #1A1A1A; letter-spacing: 4px\">LOVEKE</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 60px; right: 60px; top: 245px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-weight: 700; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase\">\n<span data-slot=\"editie\" data-label=\"Editie\" data-max=\"24\">Magazine · nr. 1</span><span data-slot=\"seizoen\" data-label=\"Seizoen\" data-max=\"24\">Herfst 2026</span></div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 60px; right: 60px; top: 285px; height: 5px; background: #1A1A1A\"></div>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/product-photos/akke-duo-sticker.png\" alt=\"Akke in de Classic Hoodie en Nastya in de Classic Sweatshirt\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 330px; top: 330px; height: 1080px; display: block; transform: rotate(2deg); filter: drop-shadow(14px 14px 0 #1A1A1A)\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 50px; top: 360px; width: 360px; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 66px; line-height: .95\" data-slot=\"kop1\" data-label=\"Kop 1\" data-max=\"34\" data-multiline=\"true\">Exclusief: het koppel achter het merk</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 50px; top: 640px; width: 320px; font-family: 'Caveat', cursive; font-weight: 700; font-size: 54px; line-height: 1.05; color: #FFF8F0; -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #1A1A1A\" data-slot=\"kop2\" data-label=\"Kop 2\" data-max=\"40\" data-multiline=\"true\">\"2,5 jaar en nog altijd matching\"</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 50px; top: 860px; width: 330px; background: #FFD43D; border: 5px solid #1A1A1A; border-radius: 22px; box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #1A1A1A; padding: 16px 20px; transform: rotate(-3deg)\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1\" data-slot=\"look1\" data-label=\"Look 1\" data-max=\"24\">Hij: Classic Hoodie</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 40px; color: #E3404B\" data-slot=\"prijs1\" data-label=\"Prijs 1\" data-max=\"10\">€59,95</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 70px; top: 1060px; width: 330px; background: #FFF8F0; border: 5px solid #1A1A1A; border-radius: 22px; box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #1A1A1A; padding: 16px 20px; transform: rotate(2deg)\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1\" data-slot=\"look2\" data-label=\"Look 2\" data-max=\"26\">Zij: Classic Sweatshirt</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 40px; color: #E3404B\" data-slot=\"prijs2\" data-label=\"Prijs 2\" data-max=\"10\">€59,95</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; right: 40px; top: 330px; width: 190px; height: 190px; border-radius: 50%; background: #E3404B; border: 6px solid #1A1A1A; box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #1A1A1A; transform: rotate(10deg); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; color: #FFF8F0; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1\" data-slot=\"badge\" data-label=\"Badge\" data-max=\"20\" data-multiline=\"true\">geen<br>modellen!</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 60px; bottom: 34px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: 2px\" data-slot=\"voet\" data-label=\"Voetregel\" data-max=\"24\">LOVEKE.BE</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}